# AQP Admin

- `aqp_admin/` is the internal admin surface for AQP's **managed
  services** and **company accounts**. It is NOT a customer-facing
  admin and NOT a replacement for `aqp_control_plane`.
- **Never import `aqp.*`** in `aqp_admin/src/aqp_admin/`. Shared value
  types come from [aqp_platform_core](mdc:aqp_platform_core). HTTP-only
  access to the AQP monolith and control plane.
- **Audit-first.** Every mutating route writes a structured audit
  record BEFORE performing the action. Mirrors the `workload_runs`
  pattern in `aqp_platform_core/src/aqp_platform_core/runtime/workload.py`.
- **Identity** flows through `IdentityProvider` (AQP rule 27). Never
  call vendor SDKs (Auth0, MSAL) directly from route handlers.
- **Credentials** resolve through `CredentialResolver` (AQP rule 26).
  Never read `settings.*_secret` directly.
- **Step-up MFA** on every destructive admin route per AGENTS rule 52.
  Use `aqp_admin.deps.stepup.require_admin_step_up(*scopes)`. The
  legacy allowlist for `aqp_admin/halt.py` is closed.
- **No Casbin.** The RBAC admin module wraps the canonical 4-role
  lattice in
  [`aqp_platform_core.auth.rbac`](mdc:aqp_platform_core/src/aqp_platform_core/auth/rbac.py)
  plus the existing `Membership` table. Don't introduce a parallel
  policy engine.
- **Never print or return raw tokens, kubeconfigs, or secret payloads.**
  Enforces the always-on rule at
  [aqp-management-engine.mdc](mdc:.cursor/rules/aqp-management-engine.mdc).
- **Frontend** (`aqp_admin/frontend/`) is the canonical Next.js 15
  App Router surface. The legacy Vite SPA at
  `aqp_admin/aqp_admin_ui/` stays deployable behind a feature flag
  for a 30-day rollback window during the cutover. Both follow the
  same throttled-WS, kill-switch, sandbox-indicator, and
  typed-confirmation contracts as `aqp_client/`. See
  [frontend.mdc](mdc:.cursor/rules/frontend.mdc).

## Where changes go

| Change | Location |
| --- | --- |
| New `/admin/*` route | `aqp_admin/src/aqp_admin/api/routers/` |
| New account flow | `aqp_admin/src/aqp_admin/accounts/` |
| New managed-service action | `aqp_admin/src/aqp_admin/services/` |
| New billing provider | `aqp_admin/src/aqp_admin/providers/` |
| New broker method | `aqp_admin/src/aqp_admin/integrations/broker.py` |
| New WS channel | `aqp_admin/src/aqp_admin/ws/gateway.py` |
| Step-up gate | `aqp_admin/src/aqp_admin/deps/stepup.py` |
| Shared type with AQP runtime | `aqp_platform_core/src/aqp_platform_core/` |
| Frontend route | `aqp_admin/frontend/app/(admin)/<name>/page.tsx` |
| Typed API wrapper | regenerated into `aqp_admin/frontend/lib/api/generated/` |
| Shared admin UI component | `aqp_admin/frontend/components/` |

## Validation

```bash
# Backend
cd aqp_admin
pip install -e ../aqp_platform_core
pip install -e .[dev]
pytest -ra
ruff check src tests
mypy src
rg --type py "^from aqp(\.|$)|^import aqp(\.|$)" src   # must return nothing

# Frontend (canonical Next.js 15)
cd frontend
pnpm install
pnpm typecheck
pnpm lint
pnpm test
pnpm build
```
